  "customHelp": "Zenless Zone Zero TCG\\nMain Deck: exactly 71 cards; maximum 4 copies of any card.\\nBangboo: exactly 1 Bangboo.\\nCurrency: exactly 20 total cards combined between Polychromes and Monochromes.\\nOpening hand: 6 cards. You may mulligan any number from 0 to 6 once; mulliganed cards are shuffled back and replaced one-for-one.\\nStart of game: 6 cards are placed into the Life Pool; the chosen Bangboo is placed in the Bangboo Zone; 2 Polychromes are placed face up in the Wallet.\\nStart of turn: the turn player draws 2 Main Deck cards (except on the first player's first turn), draws 1 Polychrome into the Wallet, and their tapped cards untap.",
